# The INTERNAL page only. Carries grades, open-item counts, uncommitted flags,
# and local filesystem paths, so it must never reach the public repo.
# Regenerate with `python build.py`.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing: a bare `index.html` pattern is unanchored
# and also excluded docs/index.html, which silently published a 404.
